.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-branchless-init 1  "init " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
init \- Initialize the branchless workflow for this repository
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBinit\fR [\fB\-\-uninstall\fR] [\fB\-\-main\-branch\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Initialize the branchless workflow for this repository
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-uninstall\fR
Uninstall the branchless workflow instead of initializing it
.TP
\fB\-\-main\-branch\fR \fI<MAIN_BRANCH_NAME>\fR
Use the provided name as the name of the main branch.

If not set, it will be auto\-detected. If it can\*(Aqt be auto\-detected, then you will be prompted to enter a value for the main branch name.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
